 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "p1",
   "t": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.91,
   "say": "At midnight on January 1st, 2027, every product in California with Red No. 3 becomes illegal to sell. No grace period.",
   "beat": "Midnight, January 1st",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p1b",
   "t": 8.91,
   "dur": 4.31,
   "say": "The dye hides under many names. Stores get one night.",
   "beat": "",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p2",
   "t": 13.23,
   "dur": 14.06,
   "say": "Reading a label decides what's pulled. What's pulled decides which shelves, which people, which shifts, which substitutes, which trucks. Change one rule and it ripples through all of them. A system like this has to agree with itself, everywhere at once.",
   "beat": "Every part depends on every other",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p3",
   "t": 27.29,
   "dur": 7.59,
   "say": "So we asked Gemini 4 Argon to write the whole system in one continued generation: one author, holding every part in mind at once.",
   "beat": "Why one generation",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p3a",
   "t": 34.88,
   "dur": 8.39,
   "say": "646,825 tokens. 911 files. Ten hops, nine hand-offs, every one clean.",
   "beat": "",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p3b",
   "t": 43.27,
   "dur": 5.72,
   "say": "After a one-line fix, all 6,581 cross-file links line up.",
   "beat": "",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p3c",
   "t": 49.0,
   "dur": 8.22,
   "say": "A test written at token 641,687 calls a function Argon wrote 552,000 tokens earlier.",
   "beat": "",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p3pause",
   "t": 57.21,
   "dur": 1.2,
   "say": "",
   "beat": "",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p3d",
   "t": 58.41,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "say": "And it passes.",
   "beat": "",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p3e",
   "t": 61.21,
   "dur": 5.22,
   "say": "That's what a million-token model is for: the whole system in one head.",
   "beat": "",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p4",
   "t": 66.44,
   "dur": 9.41,
   "say": "But consistent code isn't correct code. Our verifier found 21,459 plan mistakes: people double-booked, tasks outside the shift.",
   "beat": "Consistent isn't correct",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p5",
   "t": 75.84,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "say": "A managed agent traced it to one root cause and fixed it. Scheduling mistakes went to zero, even in stores it never saw.",
   "beat": "Scheduling mistakes \u2192 0",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
   "id": "p6",
   "t": 83.44,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "say": "When a law changes overnight, you don't have months. Argon writes the whole system at once, the verifier proves it, the agent repairs it.",
   "beat": "Why it matters",
   "pending": null
  },
  {
